@base = http://127.0.0.1:8087/api/v1

### Public menu
GET {{base}}/menu

### Catering
GET {{base}}/catering-menu

### Settings
GET {{base}}/settings

### Login (set credentials in your HTTP client's environment)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{$dotenv OWNER_EMAIL}}","password":"{{$dotenv OWNER_PASSWORD}}"}

### Dashboard; reuse the response cookies
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard

### Price history
GET {{base}}/admin/audit

### Refresh
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh

### Logout
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
